  "criticalEvidence": [
    "ItemModuleControl3875 ctor30187 creates Props/Skills/Heroes only. Init30185->30181 stores current config.Items then30180 rereads current config.Items.Values. type1=4/5 Add id,row;6 indexer overwrite. Reinitialization does not clear; duplicate failure retains source prefix.30184 update empty;30188 Dispose clears controller singleton only.",
    "ItemModule get_ItemMgr30182 and separate ItemManager.get_Instance34333 each lazily cache DataManagerPool.GetModel<ItemManager4500>, generic3995108->26750; null lookup retries. Manager OnInit/OnRelease do not set/reset these caches.",
    "ChangeItemNum30179 sign-extends delta, wraps Int64 addition with GetItemNum, negative warns exact source string and returns false. Otherwise current manager.GetItem(current config).AddItem(delta), then Item_Change(id), then current pool.SaveData, return original next>=0. Vtable offsets220/224 resolve to ItemBase virtual slot4 AddItem, not Use/AddItemOnlyModel. No balance recheck, zero shortcut, clamp or rollback.",
    "ItemManager34334 OnInit invokes inherited UpdateData(true);34335 callback current GlobalItemManager.Init(text,this);34336 release delegates current global.Release;34337 save current global.OnSave then inherited SaveLocalData. Existing actual storage/global lifecycle/persistence composed.34338 Update and34341 ExpendReward are empty.34343 DateTime.Now used as supplied local-now host, not server clock.",
    "ItemManager.AddRewards34340 live indexed List<RewardData4549> loop: ItemHelper.GetGoodsType(itemId)==6 skips row. Otherwise current ToolControl.ToolChange(row.id,low32(row.longCount),false,emptyString,false), ignore bool. Uses actual restored ToolControl/dispatcher and explicit source goods-type delegate. No batch transaction. DataKey ItemManager uses existing DataManagerBase storage semantics.",
    "GetPackageOpenReward34344 creates List<RewardData>, AddRange3976588 then LinkedList.Clear3971048; copies row references and retains same linked list. Source field20 initialized new linked list in34345.",
    "FactoryBase34293 performs ContainsKey on current shared config table then rereads current singleton table indexer; missing emits exact error and leaves null config.34292 Produce supports type1=1 via VirtualItemFactory or9 via PackageItemFactory, else null. Each subclass constructor reruns source base lookup. ItemManager34342 supplies only passed config.id and calls Produce.",
    "VirtualItemFactory34298 type2 mapping:1 Gold4496,2 Diamond4494,4 Strength4499,5 Commander4493,8 HeroPiece4498,10 HeadBox4497,11 GamePoints4495; others null. PackageFactory34296:1 OpenAuto4490,2 OpenManual4491,others null. Resolved allocation usage IDs against original type metadata, not ambiguous shared constructor labels.",
    "Concrete entity construction remains required explicit dependency by sourceType and id. No generic inventory mutation fallback added. Tests use named recording entity fixture to validate dispatch/order only, not claim actual entity effects. Next work ItemBase4541/global reward engine and all nine entities."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Concrete item entities, global reward engine and package randomness not restored in this milestone; factory construction is an explicit boundary.",
    "14/38 counts lifecycle wiring only, not full controller business behavior or full Main owner composition.",
    "No fresh native PlayMode or Player build; isolated memory backend used for real serialization/storage pipeline tests; fixture login progress10 is test-only, never fabricated production login."
  ]
